OL,3,ANvidia revenue doubles on continued AI
OL,4,Ademand
OL,5,
OL,6,FChip giant Nvidia reported another huge
OL,7,Fjump in sales as the global race to
OL,8,Fbuild artificial intelligence (AI)
OL,9,Fsystems continues.
OL,11,FThe company said on Wednesday that it
OL,12,Fbrought in $96bn (#71bn) of revenue
OL,13,Fduring the second quarter, more than
OL,14,Fdouble the amount for the same period a
OL,15,Fyear earlier. And it expects revenue of
OL,16,F$108bn in the next quarter.
OL,18,F"AI has reached its inflection point,"
OL,19,FCEO Jensen Huang said in prepared
OL,20,Fremarks, describing the infrastructure
OL,21,Fbuildout as going "at full steam."
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
